WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Programs report their own state. No screen scraping.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:10.342
Working. Progress is reported by the program.

00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:16.406
Blocked for permission. phux surfaces that it needs you.

00:00:16.406 --> 00:00:22.518
Done. The result survives the next shell prompt.

00:00:22.518 --> 00:00:29.500
The same status is available through CLI, MCP, and metadata.

